Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 16 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The leaves are falling again…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:17.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s going to be a lot of\Ntrouble cleaning tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:20.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they’re having trouble too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:39.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything I can do for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:49.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You all went out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:54.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Their school held a bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:55.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone brings in a bunch of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:01:01.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then they sell it and use the money for the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:04.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,TITLE: “…The Mysterious Lifeform.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:43.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:48.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, let’s hold a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:52.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll sell a bunch of things and pay back the debt collector!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{book} Account Book
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:03:00.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we pay off the debts, we won’t have to vacate this place anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:04.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:06.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s do a bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you see{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:11.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we could pay off the debts with just that, we would’ve paid it off ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even a big school would only get so much out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,let alone a little preschool with a small group of kindergarteners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Running a bazaar won’t get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I caused such a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:41.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go clean up outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:52.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we were to actually run a bazaar and Kobato-chan saw how useless it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,we’d end up feeling sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see why you’d want her to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,but saying it like that won’t do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:07.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you’re too blunt, you come off as a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:26.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was the only one who was excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:41.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san and Sayaka-sensei\Nwere certainly surprised, weren’t they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:45.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the idiot part is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:54.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don’t think putting in true effort is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:05:00.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:04.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t hold onto me so much! You’re annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:07.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s do the bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:26.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You bring in things you don’t need at home, or things that you’ve made,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and then we sell them at the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s like playing store-keeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:32.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be a yakisoba seller!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That might be good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve put the details into your communication booklets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to show it to your families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.57,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:44.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:49.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s good that Kobato-chan cheered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t care either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:05:59.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign, left part is covered up}Yomogi Preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:09.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you think it’s bad to\Nput dogs and cats together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:25.57,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s true, so she can’t really say anything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:33.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you draw this, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:36.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:45.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This duck and sheep are really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:52.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:53.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:58.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I won’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:03.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t push yourself too hard either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:11.82,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san can smile like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign} Mysterious Lifeform
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What a childish act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:33.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s taken a liking to you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:40.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really… Fujimoto-kun and that person just won’t be honest with themselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:41.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, thanks for your work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:49.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s continue setting up the bazaar tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:00.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who’s “that person?”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:04.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei’s husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:10.40,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm pretty sure I took your order\Nfor your husband's birthday cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:12.67,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:19.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“That person” isn’t honest with himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:21.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of person was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not as much of a mystery as your drawing, Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re teru teru bozu! {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teru_teru_bozu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Teru teru bozu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:51.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You hang those up in hopes that the weather will get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who brought those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Naomi-chan, you made those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:04.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The teru teru bozu I make turn the weather sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:08.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was sunny when we went on our trip and went to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Those are amazing teru teru bozus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if they’ll sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:17.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll make something too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s put them together and sell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:25.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let’s put price tags on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:37.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we sell a lot of teru teru bozu,\Nwill we get to keep the preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it’ll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To tell you the truth, my mom said…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s going to have a baby soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:48.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:57.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom is on vacation starting this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:01.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,but she said she’s going back to work when the baby gets a bit bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:05.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then she said she wants Yomogi Preschool to take care of it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:10.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, I’ll be the older sister, so I’ll pick her up from the preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:14.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That way I’ll be able to see Sayaka-sensei and you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:18.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see you every day as an older sister too, Naomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:21.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, let’s do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,870)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Yomogi Preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It really got late, didn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you from Yomogi Preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:10.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Judging by your voice, are you the one who picked up the phone earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:13.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:22.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The debt collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{11:30 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.59,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to crush the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.68,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Her loan will not be extended any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:51.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That was you on the phone…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Overtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:58.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The time passed while I was putting up the posters for the bazaar…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:03.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re a bad person, so I can’t tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re an interesting girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought so on the phone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:15.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you tell Sayaka that I wouldn’t extend the payment deadline?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:21.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her that I stopped by today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:26.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When the deadline comes,\NI’ll be taking down the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the children are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:34.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t want anyone hurt, you’d better vacate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:42.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:58.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Taking down the preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so cruel to not care about the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:13.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He has such a kind-looking face, but that man was really scary somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That man? Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,F-Fujimoto-san! Were you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:22.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When you talk to yourself\Nthat loudly, of course I’d hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn’t talking to myse{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t ask him his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He was smiling a lot…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:39.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And he just called Sayaka-sensei, “Sayaka”…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:50.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did he meet Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:56.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No… He left after we spoke for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:14:01.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t tell Sayaka-sensei that he came.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:06.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just stay quiet about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you come for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:20.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I won’t forgive you if you\Nmake Sayaka-san cry any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:25.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t show your face to Sayaka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:29.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That man…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,His name’s Okiura, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:38.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What relation does he have with Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:40.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t that freaking obvious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:45.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He has the same surname as\Nthe one who married Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:48.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And he just calls her Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:56.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, that man is Sayaka-sensei’s husband?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:01.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why is he trying to take down the preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:08.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn’t get yourself involved in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:13.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve got something else to do besides that, don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:18.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t fill the bottle, you won’t be able to go that place you want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:24.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But… I’m worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:37.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What have you been sewing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A mascot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been sewing it with the cloth Chitose-san gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a rabbit…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:55.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are those supposed to be ears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:59.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn’t matter if it’s a penguin or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:02.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll work hard to make sure the bazaar is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:07.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to make more of those mysterious lifeforms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:12.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re saying the same things as Fujimoto-san! So mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:23.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s getting really dark and cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:27.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure it’ll get sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:29.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:37.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll bring something that’ll really sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s do our best today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:54.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure the teru teru bozu will give us good weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:56.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:17:00.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, don’t fall over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:02.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re selling drinks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,II won’t fall over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:04.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I said I won’t, so I won’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You two sure get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:11.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:12.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:20.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that… Fujimoto-san got it from his part-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:31.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you’d fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:36.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:40.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:57.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you’d fall over, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:19.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Customers aren’t coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:21.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We even put up all those posters…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:29.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Your parents will come later, but I’m sure other customers will come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign left}Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{right}Teru Teru Bozu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:40.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think anyone will come like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This happened because I said we should have a bazaar…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:01.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:04.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:09.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard from Kobato-san, so we came over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:09.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:10.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some yakisoba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We have iced coffee too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We can make you a cafe au lait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:20.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:24.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho and Chise were really looking forward to it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When I looked today, the posters were gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:31.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so I was worried that it’d been cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That can’t be…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:38.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t tell me he did that…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:41.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:44.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to tell everyone that the bazaar isn’t cancelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s too late for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They might come still!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t have a bazaar like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:58.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I want as many people as possible to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:02.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, after all… we all worked so hard for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:05.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All of us, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:06.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, you did too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:23.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san’s such a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:34.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She went out calling for people, so I’m going to make the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not very open, but he’s a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:38.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:46.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A sunfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody’s coming, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:55.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The rain’s let up, and it’s getting sunny too…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:58.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:05.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:09.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san came over to tell me the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So I’ve come to take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you’re having a bazaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:19.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are there any good bargains here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:22.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Where should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some yakisoba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:35.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Things are looking good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:36.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:39.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan came to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:42.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where’s Kobato-chan? She’s not back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A cup of iced coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:47.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei, iced coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.03,0:21:54.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, some energetic girl is going around,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:22:00.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,shouting “Come to the Yomogi Preschool Bazaar!”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She seemed to be really desperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:07.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so I found myself saying “Okay then, I’ll check it out later!”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:10.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and then she came and shook my hands a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:12.37,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:16.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can certainly see her doing that. That’s so like Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:21.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Naomi, sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:26.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve got a lot of customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:28.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:33.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s great that the weather cleared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:38.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.50,0:22:45.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s a bazaar at Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:50.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:54.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s a bazaar at Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Mysterious Lifeform, #2”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
